rtal.
<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:0in;mso=
-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Vendor invoices are available 24/7 through the Board =
portal<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:0=
in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">3 =96 year snow cost history is not an accurate=
 assessment of full snow costs since the community was still under construc=
tion during that period.
<o:p></o:p></li></ol>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph">Here are the numbers for your reference <o:p>=
</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph">2024 $ 34,538.77 <o:p></o:p></p>
