fo1">Already communicated to the homeowners and to Candlewood<o:p></o:p></l=
i><li class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level=
1 lfo1">There is nothing in the Declaration or Bylaws providing for a Capit=
al Contribution Fee to be paid upon closing, other than what was provided i=
n the closing docs from the developer.
 Our recommendation is to amend the Bylaws to provide for a Capital Contrib=
ution Fee based on several months of assessments. This would allow for an a=
utomatic increase in the Capital Contribution Fee that would correspond wit=
h any increases in the monthly assessment.
<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:0in;mso=
-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Work in progress
<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:0in;mso=
