istParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Bill<o:p></=
o:p></li><li style=3D"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Completed 9-1-26 &nbsp;Here =
is the homeowners response: Thank you for sending me the approval. Just one=
 point of&nbsp;clarification regarding the condition noted below.&nbsp; Is =
the requirement to have it 2 feet from the&nbsp;gate or the gate
