"margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Draft to be sent to the Board nex=
t week<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:0=
in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">To be complete the morning of the meeting.
<o:p></o:p></li></ol>
